# `@jesscss/core`

- **Role**: AST + evaluation engine used by parsers, plugins, CLI.
- **Build**: `cd packages/core && pnpm build` (outputs `lib/`)
- **Tests**: `cd packages/core && pnpm test`
- **Hot areas**: `packages/core/src/tree/**` (especially extend)

